# SQLite artefacts (a ledger is local state, never a repository file)
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# AgentPM local state: the SQLite ledger, its WAL/SHM and the 0600 token files.
# The active ledger is never tracked. Use `apm backup` for a consistent snapshot
# and `apm export` for a redacted audit copy; version workflow documents and
# fixtures instead. Cross-machine sharing goes through `apm-serve`, not git.
.apm/
